; xrRazom — placed hideout radio, for xrr_patch_hf_radio.script.
; The station catalog and the shared volume/lock controls live in
; placeable_radio's file-locals, which the module.fn patch idiom cannot reach;
; the engine's Lua unlocalizer promotes them to placeable_radio fields.
; Sections merge additively across unlocalizer files, so this extends
; [placeable_radio] rather than replacing it.

[placeable_radio]
path_radio_ch
path_radio_session
radio_ch_names
radio_frequencies
radio_vol
psi_vol
safety_lock
